  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:p001:m0000" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACBB">沖</persName>故吏青州治中<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:p001:m0007" ref="5ql_hfz_086_A">房長瑜</persName>謂<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-fangchangyu:p001:m0011" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACBBA">孜</persName>曰：「前使君忠貫昊天，操逾松竹。郎君但當端坐畫一，以荷析薪。若天運不與，幅巾待命，以下從使君。今若隨諸人之計，非唯郢州士女失高山之望，亦恐彼所不取也。」</p>
</text>
